{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a singleprofile multimodal setup with concat fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5362 and F1 of 0.5158, slightly improving upon the pca_n2000 baseline (0.5266 accuracy). The results suggest scvi_n200 may offer marginal benefits in singleprofile settings, but its relative effectiveness compared to multiprofile setups remains uncertain. The role of fusion methods and other design choices, such as aggregation, is not isolated in this configuration."
}

